{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04310","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 杨敬述","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山中别有神仙地，屈曲幽深碧涧垂。\n岩前暂驻黄金辇，席上还飞白玉巵。\n远近风泉俱合杂，高低云石共参差。\n林壑偏能留睿赏，长天莫遽下丹曦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨敬述","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}